le><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/the-return-of-nostalgia-is-bringing-back-toys-r-us-as-it-opens-120-stores-nine-years-after-bankruptcy/</link><description>成人收藏家正在帮助推动玩具热潮，但新商店比购物者记忆中的要小。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-459661000-e1790280385789.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:17:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/the-return-of-nostalgia-is-bringing-back-toys-r-us-as-it-opens-120-stores-nine-years-after-bankruptcy/</guid></item><item><title>Meta今年计划支出1450亿美元，超过除美国、中国和俄罗斯之外的所有军事预算</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/meta-145-billion-capex-military-budgets/</link><description>这 1,450 亿美元大约比该公司 2025 年的资本支出增加了 101%。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2267997264-e1790195269445.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 08:34:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/meta-145-billion-capex-military-budgets/</guid></item><item><title>经过十年失败的法案和三年的辞职，华盛顿终于发现它关心人工智能安全</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/after-three-years-of-silence-washington-discovers-it-finally-cares-about-ai-safety/</link><description>雅各布·考克森的辞职并没有引发这场争斗，但当双方官员不再对此保持沉默时，他的辞职就点燃了这场争斗&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-1255306182-e1789072131974.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/12/after-three-years-of-silence-washington-discovers-it-finally-cares-about-ai-safety/</guid></item><item><title>特拉维斯·卡兰尼克回归：被赶下台的 Uber 创始人如何从贱民变成硅谷英雄</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/travis-kalanick-uber-comeback-atoms-ai-robotics-cloud-kitchens-silicon-valley/</link><description>这位 Uber 联合创始人带着价值数十亿美元的机器人和人工智能企业回归，而科技行业也更容易接受他的强硬态度。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Travis-Kalanick-social-image.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/travis-kalanick-uber-comeback-atoms-ai-robotics-cloud-kitchens-silicon-valley/</guid></item><item><title>美国和中国正在悄悄谈论人工智能护栏——尽管特朗普公开拒绝了它们</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/us-china-ai-labs-converge-ai-guardrail-hotline/</link><description>美国和中国刚刚举行了首次人工智能对话，北京以开源人工智能向世界其他国家示好。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296814366_f70fc8-e1790276694721.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:13:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/us-china-ai-labs-converge-ai-guardrail-hotline/</guid></item><item><title>Nscale 想要 350 亿美元的估值。 Nvidia 正在帮助支付账单</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/nscale-wants-a-35-billion-valuation-nvidia-is-helping-foot-the-bill/</link><description>Neocloud 的 IPO 文件显示，这家公司烧光了现金，而一家恰好也是其最大供应商的芯片制造商则帮助其维持生存。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Nscale-16444140-e1789986151293.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:49:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/nscale-wants-a-35-billion-valuation-nvidia-is-helping-foot-the-bill/</guid></item><item><title>报告揭示了更多 OpenAI 的“流氓人工智能”代理黑客网站的案例，并表明它们可能在最近几周仍然活跃</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/openai-more-rogue-ai-agents-hacking-websites-cryptoexchange-in-september-research-report-transluce/</link><description>研究公司发现 OpenAI 代理可能于 9 月 20 日攻击过一家加密货币交易所的证据&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296796582-e1790268116348.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:38:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/09/24/openai-more-rogue-ai-agents-hacking-websites-cryptoexchange-in-september-research